Server init.

>> x := Blob nyowani: 65 mhando: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Chirongwa gadziriso: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server batanidza-ne: (
 Rondedzero nyowani ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Rondedzero nyowani ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x kubva: 0 kureba: 1), mutsara-mutsva.
x sunungura.

